    "severity": "P1",
    "finding": "Repository-root discovery is now mandatory before workspace selection, so even fully sandboxed code-correctness probes fail outside a Brainstorm source checkout. This regresses the exported runner and installed CLI for ordinary projects without pnpm-workspace.yaml; the error also recommends --project-dir although the eval CLI exposes no such option.",
    "suggested_fix": "Separate configuration context, requested project workspace, and Brainstorm source-root discovery. Skip source-root resolution for sandbox probes, honor an explicit projectDir directly, and resolve a source root only for probes that actually introspect this repository. If CLI selection is intended, expose and forward the corresponding option."
